# API Enrichment Operations Rule

When performing any of the following tasks, the agent MUST read and follow `prompts/runAPIs.md` as its system prompt:

- Running any `atoms-vs-ashes enrich` CLI command
- Running any `scripts/run_*.py` batch script
- Running any `scripts/probe_*.py` rate-limit discovery script
- Debugging a connector failure or batch error
- Modifying connector configuration in `config/default.yml`
- Analysing enrichment logs under `logs/`
- Running `scripts/report_enrichment_coverage.py`
- Any task described as "run the API", "enrich sites", "gather data", or "batch run"

## Quick Reference

- **Prompt location:** `prompts/runAPIs.md`
- **Safety rule:** `.cursor/rules/live-api-safety.mdc` (always applied — explicit consent before any live API call)
- **Lessons learned:** `prompts/lessons_learned.md` (read before every run)
- **Escalation protocol:** dry-run → 3 sites → 20 sites → country → full (user consent required at step 4+)
- **Logging:** structlog JSON to stderr + `ConnectorHttpAuditLogger` file pairs under `logs/<subsystem>/<run_id>/`
